# Retail POS module map

| Domain | API prefix | Models |
|--------|------------|--------|
| Auth / SSO | `app/api/auth/` | `User`, `Role` |
| Receipts / pay | `app/api/receipts/` | `Receipt`, lines, fiscal, room charge |
| Shifts | `app/api/shifts/` | open/close, X-report |
| Products / stock | `products/`, `stock/` | search, check, replenishment |
| Integrations | `integrations/marketplace`, `integration/` | prescription, stock write-off |
| Offline | `offline/sync` | edge replay |
| Events | `events/dispatch` | sale completed → orchestrator |
| Internal | `GET/POST /api/internal/v1/organization/bind`, `GET/POST /api/internal/v1/runtime-config` | Orch Sync bind + desired-state config; `instrumentation` boot |

Room charge when `shouldRouteRevenueToParent`; fiscal via `fiscalizeForSatellite`.
